Z||000015||mrfixit58||10-22-2001||03:59 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by cadero2dmax:<BR><B>Would you consider a Cadero list (for owners or builders, no "wannabe's)? ... We could compare notes, such as the aforementioned poly mounts. Or the status of the 5.7 SFI computer mating that is being undertaken - so that all the SBC chips and re-calibration tricks can be used? Or maybe the cam re-timing tricks? Oh, I guess I need to add etc!<P>Lemme No<P>G <P> </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Well... I'm a wanna-be and I would like in on this. The only reason I'm not currently hip-deep and a Cadaro project myself right now is because I'm neck-deep in a 68 Camaro project. Why not open it up to us wanna-be's?<P><P>------------------<BR>Roy  :D <BR>Just another stock Blue 87 GT   <BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/pennocksize.JPG">      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif"> ||||reg||9
Z||000016||Alex4mula||10-22-2001||04:17 PM||||I agree with Philphine and mrfixit58. Why that selfishness? All non-stock engine(SBC,N*, DOHC 3.4,etc.)owners here started as wannabes who after researching the info then got into the project. You can also charge for access if you really want to keep it to nobody...<P>------------------<BR>    Alex4mula<BR>:) Red-Original Owner & White-1/94 with PM (:||||reg||1
Z||000017||rockcrawl||10-22-2001||06:44 PM||||Ooops, I forgot about Dale and Todd. Hey guys! Dale, congrats on getting yours running! <BR> I have no objection to making the Cadero list public, we'll just get so technical that they have no idea what we're talking about  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> ....What did you do about the UART line for the IPC, DERM and BCM, and the PSPS and HWS inputs, and how could I control the ISC with a 730.... Nah, just kidding. I think the Cadero group should be made public. I'm all for sharing info. I'm not trying to make any money from this or keep it a secret. In fact I've sent out passkey bypass circuits to two forum members to help them get their engines running...no charge. I've spent hours typing emails to people discussing these swaps. I think it would be good to have a group where we could discuss the swap and get answers from people who know or have had the same experience. That way when I type an email it will be seen by everyone who wants to see it, and hopefully someone can either learn from it or add to it. At this point I believe I am the only one who has converted to an F-body ECM. It has taken me weeks of tuning to get to the point I'm at now, and there are still a few details that need to be worked out. Frankly I could use some help and suggestions, but I don't think Pennock's is the place to have detailed discussions about a very specific topic, discussions that may go on for months or more. A Cadero group, public or private, would be beneficial, but only if there are enough people that are actively participating on a regular basis. Then again, why would I want to share info with Ed Parks, so he can use my hard work to make a profit? Can you tell there's a hidden story here?<P><BR>BlackDragon, The 350 will be coming out within a week or two. I have no idea what hugh wants for it, you'll need to discuss that with him. My friend Ryan and two of my nephews were here when the car arrived, you should have seen the grins on their faces when he fired it up to drive it off the rollback!<P>||||reg||7
Z||000018||westtexas||10-22-2001||08:18 PM||||Rockcrawl, your web page of the swap is a real help to me. Installing the alternator and idler is my next step. Your work looks like something I would see in a magazine. How fast is your 4.9 right now compared to other swaps? I'm using bubba's mounts. We'll see how they hold up as well as an unmodified TH125.<P>Robert||||reg||1
Z||000019||cadero2dmax||10-22-2001||08:51 PM||||The majority rules!! <P>I will make the list public, but if it goes the direction of BubbaJoes list then I will close it.<P>There are people on that list that have never seen a 4.X series Cad engine before, that literally try to answer every question asked. I have looked all over for people that know this conversion, and hope for this list to end up being the one place for 4.X owners to go. <P>G||||reg||1
