Z||000023||Slammed Fiero||10-23-2001||12:11 AM||||Just a little info for you all.<P>Once upon a time george (cadero2dmax)<BR> created The Fiero racing list..all was good and happy. Then it turned into a cess pool , infighting , disputes , open flame wars , beating a thread topic to death. It turned into crap.<P>George got fed up and I took over the list as owner moderator. I don't know what happened in all of the fights , but it was quite brutal. It took a while but were back to normal, I can honestly say it's probably the best , crap free list on the net. We get maybe one post per month that is useless , and we don't get 10000 people replying to it online. a few months back George snuck back on the list (only I knew)<P>So in retrospect..any list you join that is run by George will no doubt be informative and run with discipline.. No doubt you will never see "Sex in a Fiero" pop up. Anyone who knows George or has seen his posts on the racing list , knows that when the man talks...you listen!<P>In anycase , I think I will join. Something appealing about a plain 84 (red of course) with single exhaust sticking out , that looks Bone stock with a Caddy V8 in it. Cheap too! <P>That swap has Car Craft or hot rod written all over it. They love home built Cheap sleepers<P>JM ||||reg||1
